`internal/cli/refresh.go:658`: historyIndexCurrent calls the panic-on-error loadSessionTombstones convenience loader instead of the checked loader. A healthy history projection plus a malformed tombstones.json produces a panic rather than the typed error used at other serving/build boundaries. TestAuditHistoryFreshnessPanicsOnCorruptPrivacy confirms it. Propagate policy failure through freshness callers without crashing refresh/status/worker processes. Evidence: audit-refreshprivacy*.

